Greetings all,

I downloaded the 4.02 and 4.03 patches for XFree and
ended up with a dead XServer.  I checked the config
files (which moved during the 4.02 install to
/etc/X11) and all seemed well.  When the Xserver
started however, the Xserver crashed and reported
"unresolved" for a number of graphic functions
pointing to my accelerator's driver (mga_drv.o).  I
verified that all files within the compressed gunzips
were extracted (install using the Xinstall.sh script
went without error) and that the driver mga_drv.o was
where it was supposed to be.  I'm not sure at this
point what the "unresolved" is indicating, as the
correct files are located where the docs indicate. 
Same behavior under 4.02 as the patched 4.03.  

I've noticed several users of this list running
4.02/4.03 and wanted to know what you may have done to
get 4.02/-.03 running. 

--KE

