> I am trying to mount / via NFS on an HP (HPUX10.20) to back it up.  I can
> get / to export and mount succesfully from an x86 machine.  HOwever, when
> I try to mount / from my miata, the HP returns "mount: access denied for
> 192.168.1.15:/".  My /etc/exports is the same for both machines; e.g. "/
> 192.168.1.0/255.255.255.0(rw,no_root_squash)".  I know that it is being
