> idea?? I thought this card works on alpha linux?

Stock 4.0.3 was missing some Alpha support for older (pre-EV6) machines.

Either pick up the 4.0.3 patches on gatekeeper.dec.com:

	/pub/DEC/Linux-Alpha/X11/diffs-403-01apr2150.gz

or use 4.1.0, in which all the patches are incorporated (and also get
a very nice performance boost from unrelated enahncements).

