Interesting tidbit, there is a win2k version for Alpha floating around.
In fact, from what I'd been told MS is useing the "Alpha experience"
(their words not mine) to get NT technology working on the upcoming IA64.

My bootleg copy of WIN2k never showed up, but these people working for MS
still claim that they have WIN2k and have even seen XP?!!? Running on
Compaq Alpha machines.  Don't know how much of this to believe, but hey,
thought I'd throw it out into the rumor mill.  Maybe someone with more
reliable MS contacts can quiz a few people.


