Friends:

I found a work around to the 3Com Vortex problem when 
UPGRADING to RH7.0.  I did the Install instead, and lo and behold 
up comes the network with the good ole' 3c59x driver.  No clue as 
to why upgrading RH6.1 to RH7.0 wouldn't configure/detect/load 
the NIC/driver.

Now I am delving into the documentation on kerberos so as to 
return all the passwd to the right users.  I have tar archives for the / 
partition, /home, /usr/local   .  But inserting the old /etc/passwd is 
insufficient.  Anyone know a quick fix?

Thanks for all the suggestions on where networking could foul up.

Best regards,
Will



